    "body": "## Scope\n\nThis draft PR implements the institutional Moral Trade system in three coherent layers:\n\n### Beta 1 — transaction integrity\n- mandates\n- resource and bottleneck profiles\n- counterfactual baselines\n- confidential matching\n- deal rooms\n- multi-party obligations\n- budget reservations\n- risk review\n- performance monitoring\n- dispute states\n- operator Deal Desk\n\n### Beta 2 — repeatability\n- institutional track record\n- reusable templates\n- framework agreements\n- independent verifiers\n- board packets\n- structured reporting\n- permission-aware Command integration\n\n### Beta 3 — collective coordination\n- institutional consortium trades\n- moral-public-goods pools\n- anchor and underwriter structures\n- contribution and threshold governance\n- advanced matching\n- enterprise integration foundations\n\nThe implementation will preserve person-level authentication, represent organizations/programs/legal counterparties separately, enforce scoped authority and approvals, retain immutable versions and audit events, and avoid universal moral-impact scoring.\n\nThe temporary source-export workflow exists only to obtain the exact branch source for local implementation and verification. It will be removed before review completion.",
